OL,3,GNEWSAGas worker 'may have left valve
OL,4,Aopen', trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas worker told another member of
OL,7,Fstaff that he had not done a test on a
OL,8,Fgas supply which later caused an
OL,9,Fexplosion killing 10 people, a court
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FCommercial sales manager for Island
OL,13,FEnergy Andrew Robinson said Neil
OL,14,FArmstrong had told him on the morning
OL,15,Fof the explosion that he "may have left
OL,16,Fthe [gas] valve open" when on a job at
OL,17,FHaut du Mont the day before.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
