OL,3,GNEWSAGas worker 'may have left valve
OL,4,Aopen', trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmstrong was part of the team who
OL,7,Fworked to restore gas to nearby
OL,8,Fproperties after supplies were
OL,9,Faccidentally disconnected during work
OL,10,Fthe day before the explosion on 10
OL,11,FDecember 2022.
OL,13,FGas workers Armstrong, 58, John Wright,
OL,14,F60, and Lee Ward, 59, deny 10 counts of
OL,15,Fgross negligence manslaughter.
